{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664430/extras/uncover.jpg?t=1746476023\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the world of Silver Malfeasant and uncover the entity behind freakish, cybernetic-related mutilations. Use your company-issued detective cybernetics and talk to the city's colourful denizens to earn clues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your investigative abilities will be tested, and your actions will have consequences. The case's outcome will change based on your choices; which will you discover?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664430/extras/silvertree_city.jpg?t=1746476023\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A layered city, where all walks of life dwell. <br>Explore the Undercity and the factions that control its different layers. Be wary of biases and uncover the history between groups or individuals. Is everyone really who they say they are? And what about those that live above?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664430/extras/map.jpg?t=1746476023\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664430/extras/are_you_safe.jpg?t=1746476023\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Something lurks out in the dark of night; do you dare face it? The risk might yield something crucial to your investigation...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664430/extras/Kit_run.gif?t=1746476023\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664430/extras/a_helping_hand.jpg?t=1746476023\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>(Full game only)</i> <br>Aid the city's residents in solving their problems to earn extra clues or money to further enhance your detective cybernetics. After all, what use is money when life is on the line?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3664430?t=1746476023","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664430/b559dcaab9379385a4381403443d1831669f4e9e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746476023","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664430/84f909cc18a6f81e685b352bce5dd70e73245d72/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746476023","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664430/84f909cc18a6f81e685b352bce5dd70e73245d72/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746476023","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Themes include light body horror and corpses."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664430/extras/uncover.jpg?t=1746476023\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the world of Silver Malfeasant and uncover the entity behind freakish, cybernetic-related mutilations. Use your company-issued detective cybernetics and talk to the city's colourful denizens to earn clues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your investigative abilities will be tested, and your actions will have consequences. The case's outcome will change based on your choices; which will you discover?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664430/extras/silvertree_city.jpg?t=1746476023\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A layered city, where all walks of life dwell. <br>Explore the Undercity and the factions that control its different layers. Be wary of biases and uncover the history between groups or individuals. Is everyone really who they say they are? And what about those that live above?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664430/extras/map.jpg?t=1746476023\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664430/extras/are_you_safe.jpg?t=1746476023\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Something lurks out in the dark of night; do you dare face it? The risk might yield something crucial to your investigation...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664430/extras/Kit_run.gif?t=1746476023\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664430/extras/a_helping_hand.jpg?t=1746476023\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>(Full game only)</i> <br>Aid the city's residents in solving their problems to earn extra clues or money to further enhance your detective cybernetics. After all, what use is money when life is on the line?</p>","developers":["Violet Mischief"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664430/aa0d253f2eaa173f23fb55c115da61c85b33bad6/header.jpg?t=1746476023","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257129344,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257129344/movie480.mp4?t=